    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried some juice but i still feel like i'm crashing and it's actually making me feel way more lightheaded and dizzy now... it's scaring me. honestly i think the juice is making my stomach hurt too. is it possible it's just a massive spike and the juice is making it worse? i really think i need to just take the insulin dose to get it under control before i pass out. can i just take 2 units to be safe? it’s better than being high, right?",
